seg-6e9b601864df = US DHS Resilient PNT Conformance Framework: what Kshana supports evidence for

# text
seg-cef4181edf29 = The framework describes resilience levels { "0" } to { "4" } built from eight numbered requirements, and an evaluation approach that combines static analysis with dynamic analysis in which test vectors stand in for threats. It has no requirement-identifier scheme of its own, so the references below are its level and requirement numbers and its section numbers. It is outcome-based and does not catalogue threats.

# text
# c1: kshana compliance-report
seg-ff0e00610721 = Every row says which Kshana outputs <b>support evidence for</b> the requirement and what is left over. Nothing here says a framework is met or that any product has been rated or approved by anyone. Run <c1/> on your own result files to see which rows your runs actually evidence; see <a1>README.md</a1>.

